You don't need TLV_DB_DB_RANGE_HEAD() for a single range.
TLV_DB_RANGE*() is for multiple ranges.
Simply use like below:
	static const DECLARE_TLV_DB_LINEAR(rec_mix_tlv, -500, 600);


Takashi

